an or this woman would you say she  was innocent in all this did she do you  think she had any  uh interaction with this man or know him  again as far as them knowing each other  i don't know but i know she was not  involved in the domestic disturbance i  know she was inside of her apartment  and that the suspect left his apartment  went upstairs  went inside her apartment and that is  when she was killed so there's nothing  at this point  that indicates that um to answer your  question yes  she is a innocent victim that was inside  of her apartment  and then just a quick unrelated question  we're hearing about some incident at  boulder station  uh people evacuated from a floor do you  guys know anything about that i have no  idea regarding the boulder station i  well i do know there's an incident  happening at boulder station but i don't  know any specific details for it all  right thank you guys
 

